@anon.8ad231a129453d088979dfad2582f60a.1294 = private unnamed_addr constant [760 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks that a TODO comment is associated with a link to a relevant issue\0Aor ticket.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AIncluding an issue link near a TODO makes it easier for resolvers\0Ato get context around the issue.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0A# TODO: this link has no issue\0A```\0A\0AUse one of these instead:\0A```python\0A# TODO(charlie): this comment has an issue link\0A# https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/issues/3870\0A\0A# TODO(charlie): this comment has a 3-digit issue code\0A# 003\0A\0A# TODO(charlie): https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/issues/3870\0A# this comment has an issue link\0A\0A# TODO(charlie): #003 this comment has a 3-digit issue code\0A# with leading character `#`\0A\0A# TODO(charlie): this comment has an issue code (matches the regex `[A-Z]+\\-?\\d+`)\0A# SIXCHR-003\0A```\0A", align 1
