@anon.8ad231a129453d088979dfad2582f60a.1297 = private unnamed_addr constant [18 x i8] c"missing-todo-colon", align 1
@anon.8ad231a129453d088979dfad2582f60a.1298 = private unnamed_addr constant [415 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks that a \22TODO\22 tag is followed by a colon.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0A\22TODO\22 tags are typically followed by a parenthesized author name, a colon,\0Aa space, and a description of the issue, in that order.\0A\0ADeviating from this pattern can lead to inconsistent and non-idiomatic\0Acomments.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0A# TODO(charlie) fix this colon\0A```\0A\0AUsed instead:\0A```python\0A# TODO(charlie): colon fixed\0A```\0A", align 1
